# Languages + countries floor (all Gotigin products)

Canonical: `docs/WEBSITES.md` § Language catalogue + 199 countries ·
`docs/DEV.md` § Languages.

## Floor

Every **app and website** under Gotigin brands (Kumkaj products, Wadhu,
Ghal Bol, gotigin.com) supports:

- the full language catalogue (**115+ languages**), and
- **199 countries** (world / market coverage; Khaynjo world shelf is the
  concrete 199-row reference).

## Do

- Ship the full catalogue picker and a pack for every table language the
  picker can select.
- Keep app ↔ site catalogue parity gates green.
- Verify language change in a local preview before any Hosting deploy.

## Do not

- Ship a smaller language subset or a preference-only picker.
- Treat Gotigin / Wadhu / Ghalbol sites as English-only while showing a
  language chip.
- Invent fake language or country counts; use the catalogue and the
  199-country table as source of truth.
